      <h1>Baked Mac and Cheese</h1>
      <p>This simple yet delicious recipe for baked mac and cheese is to die for!</p>
      <h2>Ingredients</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Pasta Noodles</li>
        <li>Cheddar Cheese</li>
        <li>Heavy Whipping Cream</li>
        <li>Seasonings of your choice</li>
        <li>Butter</li>
        <li>Olive Oil</li>
        <li>Onions</li>
        <li>Garlic</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Instructions</h2>
      <ol>
        <li>Boil pasta noodles until complete and tender. <em>You can add some olive oil to the noodles after to help them not stick</em></li>
        <li>Take a pan, heat it up and add some oil and butter to the pan. Once heated add in the onions and garlic until fragrent and translusent.</li>
        <li>Once done with onions, add in some more butter and some heavy whipping cream and stir.</li>
        <li>After that is combined, add in your cheddar cheese and stir until completed combined</li>
        <li>Place your pasta noodles in a baking dish and add your cheese sauce ontop of it. Be sure to mix together completely.</li>
        <li>Add somemore cheese to the top and bake for about 15 minutes or until golden brown at the top.</li>
      </ol>
